    <string name="permission_dialog_accessibility_service_message">Accessibility service permissions are required in order to create a virtual mouse pointer, respond to keyboard shortcuts (like opening the app switcher) and integrating editor controls. If it\'s not enabled, Deskflow can not function.\n\nPrivacy: Deskflow uses this access only on this device to carry out the input from your computer. Screen content is not sent anywhere; data is only exchanged with the Deskflow server you set up.</string>
